        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Tell Manufacturing LC2200 Series Standard Duty Commercial  Leversets</b>\r\n<p>\r\nStandard Duty Commercial  Leversets complies with ANSI/BHMA A156.4, Series 4000, Grade 2. Listed by UL / ULC for ratings of \u001cA\u001d  label (3 hours) and less, UL10C / UBC 7-2 (1997) positive pressure, for single doors up to 4\u0019'0\"\u001d x 8'\u00190\"\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><b>ADA compliant levers</b></a> (conform to A117.1 Barrier Free Accessibility Code) are solid cast and fully adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> for Tell LC2200 Series Commercial Door Levers\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard 160/161 door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\".</li>\r\n<li>Case: Steel mechanism. zinc dichromated plate for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 4-7/8\" X 1-1/4\" (Standard ASA Strike)</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: Stainless steel with 1/2\" throw. Deadlocking for keyed lock functions.</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non-handed.</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Keyways: Schlage \"C\" Standard.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Brass 6-pin cylinder keyed to 5-pins.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim, one (1) side.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry: Outside lever locked and unlocked by key. Push  button locking inside.</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Storeroom: Outside lever fixed. Entry by key only. Inside lever always unlocked. </li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
